      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 4 · Conservative FL2VA experiment\nThe FL2VA example starts at `512x288x124` and learned-upscales to `1024x576x124`. Its actual width/height already feed HIGH Conditioning. The first and last images remain separate user inputs, but both are pre-aligned to 1024x576 before reuse across the two passes. FL2VA has static contract coverage but no equivalent real two-pass render yet, so keep one job at a time."
      ]
